    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44772" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔπηκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well put together, well-built</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνὶ μεγάρῳ εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.661
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχῷ κλισίης εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				9.663
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχῷ θαλάμων εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.41
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύριγγα ἐκ καρῶ
			εὐπάκτοιο</span> of <i>well-moulded, compact</i>, wax, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.128
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); <i>firm</i>, of bandaging, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).904
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of fluids,
				<i>easily congealed</i> or <i>frozen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Long.</u>
				466a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				467a8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
